.TH QFW_SLURM_INSTALL.SH 1 "September 2026" "qfw-slurm 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qfw_slurm_install.sh \- build and install qfw-slurm
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./setup/qfw_slurm_install.sh
.BI --prefix " prefix"
.BI --python " python"
.RI [ --source-dir " directory" ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B qfw_slurm_install.sh
is the source-tree convenience installer. It delegates native configuration,
compilation, and installation to CMake. It then installs the Python gateway
package into the explicitly selected Python environment.
.PP
The installer does not build QFw, edit Slurm configuration, install protected
site configuration, create service accounts, or start the gateway.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --prefix " prefix"
Set the native CMake installation prefix. This option is required.
.TP
.BI --python " python"
Select the Python interpreter that receives the gateway package. The
interpreter should belong to the matching QFw virtual environment. This option
is required unless
.B --skip-gateway
is used.
.TP
.BI --source-dir " directory"
Use an explicit qfw-slurm source tree. The default is the parent of the source
installer. This option is required when invoking the installed reference copy.
.TP
.BI --build-dir " directory"
Set the CMake build directory. The default is
.I build
under the source tree.
.TP
.B --without-plugin
Configure with
.BR QFW_SLURM_BUILD_PLUGIN=OFF .
This permits a driver and native-library build without Slurm headers. It omits
both the SPANK module and controller epilog.
.TP
.B --skip-gateway
Skip Python gateway installation and make
.B --python
optional.
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Print the command summary.
.SH PYTHON REQUIREMENTS
Install
.I setup/build-requirements.txt
and
.I setup/requirements.txt
into the selected environment before invoking the installer. Gateway
installation uses pip with build isolation and dependency resolution disabled,
so it does not contact a package index or modify unrelated dependencies.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates that every selected installation step completed. Argument,
CMake, compiler, install, or pip failures return nonzero.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I setup/qfw_slurm_install.sh
Source-tree installer.
.TP
.I libexec/qfw-slurm/qfw_slurm_install.sh
Installed reference copy below the selected prefix.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qfw-slurm-driver (1),
.BR qfw-slurm (7)
